#: ../../source/developer-guides/index.md:5 c8cbd3a14f9c4f0b9c9bbb6da1e1f75a
msgid "开发者指南"
msgstr "Developer Guides"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/index.md:7 6e3854666f334779816f827066c8f555
msgid "通过统一的注册、配置与训练接口，扩展模型、数据源和训练流程。"
msgstr ""
"Extend models, data sources, and training workflows through unified "
"registration, configuration, and training interfaces."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/index.md:9 2c3b04d8515c42ee9746058ed380834f
msgid "[自定义模型](customize-model.md)：实现模型、数据准备与训练器，声明配置并注册。"
msgstr ""
"[Custom Models](customize-model.md): Implement models, data preparation, "
"and trainers, declaring configs and registering them."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/index.md:10 62ea77cafe384a7fa23e0c26ea097245
msgid "[多阶段训练](multi-stage-training.md)：组织训练阶段，管理组件构建、状态传递与联合推断。"
msgstr ""
"[Multi-Stage Training](multi-stage-training.md): Organize training "
"stages, managing component building, state passing, and joint inference."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/index.md:11 76f8eb20133e4ec0b737ba3d4611cd14
msgid "[自定义数据集](customize-dataset.md)：接入数据源，完成实体映射、序列切分与交叉验证数据准备。"
msgstr ""
"[Custom Datasets](customize-dataset.md): Integrate data sources, "
"completing entity mapping, sequence slicing, and cross-validation data "
"preparation."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/index.md:12 d4727d7b16ef405a8729f5b8abd8520b
msgid "[回调与损失](customize-callback.md)：扩展训练生命周期，接入周期性更新与自定义损失。"
msgstr ""
"[Callbacks & Losses](customize-callback.md): Extend the training "
"lifecycle, integrating periodic updates and custom loss functions."
